#NOTES APPLICATION- GROUP 2
A simple digital notebook that allows users to create, view, edit, delete, and search personal note
## Main features 
-Create new notes
-Display saved notes
-Edit and delete notes
-Search by title or keyword
-Save notes using Local Storage
## Planned Functions
- addNote()
- displayNotes()
- editNote()
- deleteNote()
- searchNotes()
- saveToLocalStorage()
- loadFromLocalStorage()
##TEAM DEVELOPMENT
The project will be developed collaboratively using Git and GitHub. Features will be added gradually and each major feature will be recorded using a separate commit.
## How to Run
Open index.html in a web browser to use the application.
